World "LeanBasics"
Title "Lean Basics"

Introduction "
Before any linear algebra: the handful of Lean moves every later proof uses. Sixteen short
levels, each with one or two new ideas — about an hour in all.

Levels 1–12 are logic (goals, rewriting, \"and\", \"or\", \"not\", \"exists\", \"for all\");
13–15 are vectors and matrices; 16 is the format of every true-or-false sheet question.
"
